    {
      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "body",
      "narration_text": "So the toolkit looks first. Its visual gate samples every beat at three moments and checks the frames. Text bleeding off the edge, crowded margins, overflowing boxes, type too small to read, and big empty canvas. Any major defect, and the cut fails.",
